teach_text = "Sometimes people say things that are inevitably true."
bottom_out_text = "Since A1, B3 and C3 agree and there are only 2 liars, they must tell the truth, so C1 tells the truth as well, and has at least one lying neighbor. B2 has to tell the truth, overwise it would create a contradiction. This means C2 tells the truth as well, so B1 has to lie. The last liar has to be A2 or A3, who accuse each other. Since the liars have to be neighbors, it can only be A2."

